TV5-D23 validation evidence
===========================

Task: TV5-D23 Leader cũ quay lại (Raft Election + Recovery — Old Leader Rejoin, Step-Down & Uncommitted Suffix Repair over FakeNetwork + TestNetworkFilter)
Date: 2026-11-23
Base Commit: c80341d (branch Huu)
Environment: Linux 7.3.3-300.fc45.x86_64 (amd64), OpenJDK 25.0.4.1, Apache Maven 3.9.11
Scope: backend-node election package; 5-peer cluster over deterministic FakeNetwork integrated with TestNetworkFilter (TV3-D21); partition 3–2 heal; old-term leader receiving higher-term heartbeat or AppendEntries (or higher-term AppendEntriesResponse) steps down immediately via TV5-D14 StepDownHandler (HigherTermHandler + PersistentElectionState + LeadershipGuard + PersistentRaftNode + RaftElectionComponent); coordinates directly with TV4 log-repair stack (AppendEntriesHandler + LogConflictResolver + PersistentLogAppender + LogConsistencyChecker + ReplicationTracker + CommitAdvancer) without waiting for TV4-D23; repairs single, long (Raft Fig. 7), and multi-term uncommitted suffixes durably while protecting committed prefix [1..commitIndex]; verifies TC-RAFT-03, TC-RAFT-06, TC-RAFT-07, TC-RAFT-08, TC-RAFT-09, AC08, AC09 invariants on FakeNetwork. Real 5-node TCP/PostgreSQL rejoin and log repair are scheduled for Gate G6.

Deliverables:
- backend-node/src/test/java/vn/nhom6/railway/raft/election/RejoinTest.java (14-scenario rejoin, step-down & suffix-repair suite)
- artifacts/evidence/D23/TV5-D23-result.log (this evidence file)
- docs/implementation/TV5-D23-notes.md (technical notes & verification summary)

Dependencies & Integration:
- TV5-D14 StepDownHandler stack: HigherTermHandler, PersistentElectionState, LeadershipGuard, PersistentRaftNode, RaftElectionComponent, ElectionTimer, LeaderHeartbeatScheduler.
- TV5-D22 Partition Tests & Network Filter: TestNetworkFilter (TV3-D21) + deterministic FakeNetwork 3–2 partition/heal and asymmetric isolation.
- TV4 Log Repair & Replication stack (existing, not waiting for TV4-D23): AppendEntriesHandler, LogConflictResolver, PersistentLogAppender, LogConsistencyChecker, ReplicationTracker, CommitAdvancer.
- TV2 Booking State Machine: BookingStateMachine, BookingCommand, ApplyResult, BookingRequestHandler.NotLeaderException.
- Scope boundary: RejoinTest fake network PASS; real rejoin/log repair on 5 physical/Docker nodes + PostgreSQL verified at Gate G6.

Verified Scenarios in RejoinTest (14/14 PASS):
1.  rejoinAfterHeal_oldLeaderReceivesHigherTermHeartbeat_stepsDownPersistsAndArmsTimer: PASS
2.  rejoinAfterHeal_oldLeaderSendsStaleAppendToMajority_stepsDownViaHigherTermHandlerOnResponse: PASS
3.  rejoinAfterHeal_heartbeatAloneDoesNotTruncateUnmatchedSuffix_andDoesNotAdvanceCommitPastMatchedIndex: PASS
4.  rejoinAfterHeal_singleUncommittedGhostWrite_truncatedDurablyAndReplacedByNewLeader: PASS
5.  rejoinAfterHeal_longDivergentUncommittedSuffix_longerThanNewLeaderLog_truncatedAndRepaired: PASS
6.  rejoinAfterHeal_multiTermCascadingDivergence_oldLeaderWithMultipleStaleTermsBacktracksAndRepairs: PASS
7.  rejoinAfterHeal_bothMinorityNodesHaveDivergentSuffixes_allFiveNodesConvergeExactly: PASS
8.  rejoinAfterHeal_oldLeaderRestartsFromDurableStorageWithUncommittedSuffix_repairsWithoutDoubleApply: PASS
9.  rejoinAfterHeal_staleDelayedResponsesFromOldTerm_ignoredByLeadershipGuardAndNeverCommit: PASS
10. rejoinAfterHeal_committedPrefixProtection_conflictAtCommittedIndexFailsClosed: PASS
11. rejoinAfterHeal_storageFailureDuringHigherTermStepDown_stopsLeaderAndFailsClosed: PASS
12. rejoinAfterHeal_realRaftElectionComponentLifecycle_stopsHeartbeatSchedulerAndRepairsSuffix: PASS
13. rejoinAfterHeal_oldLeaderClientRedirectionAndIdempotentRetry_succeedsOnNewLeader: PASS
14. rejoinAfterHeal_oldLeaderCanBeReelectedInLaterTermAfterCatchUp: PASS

